              <div class="lozen-quiz__intro">
                <p class="lozen-eyebrow">Begin</p>
                <h3 class="lozen-quiz__intro-title">
                  What is your workforce risk profile?
                </h3>
                <p class="lozen-quiz__intro-body">
                  Lower turnover can create false reassurance. Your organization
                  may appear stable while resignation risk, leadership strain,
                  benefits underuse, and succession exposure are forming.
                  Complete the scorecard to see whether your current systems are
                  detecting risk early, only after disclosure, or only after an
                  exit.
                </p>
                <p class="lozen-quiz__intro-speed">
                  Five questions. Under two minutes.
                </p>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="lozen-btn lozen-btn--primary lozen-btn--lg"
                  data-quiz-start
